If you would like to reset the configuration of the software
back to the initial default settings, click Revert Settings.
It is sometimes necessary to revert the settings in cases of file
corruption. If you are experiencing an error, you may wish to try
exiting the software and cycling power on the instrument first, to
see if the error condition can be cleared in this way.

